 "description": "Goldbeter1996 - Cyclin Cdc2 kinase Oscillations\nBioModels BIOMD0000000729 (curated). SBML file: Goldbeter1996.xml.\nSimulation: 0 to 80 time units (SED-ML: Goldbeter1996.sedml), sampling 0.08.\nRun switches: -ig:mass -INT:1 -obeymaxint\nVerification against libRoadRunner (SBML reference): PASS, max |difference| = 8.01e-07 of species peak (worst: C)\nSBML time units are used unchanged as Kintecus seconds.\nConversion notes:\n  [info] Cyclin_degradation: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] Cdc2_kinase_inactivation: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] X_inactivation: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\nRenamed species (Kintecus name = SBML id): M1 = M",
